	<MooGirl.SlaveApparelDef ParentName="MooGirl_BrainWashApparel">
		<defName>MooGirl_BrainwashHelmet</defName>
		<label>雪牛娘 洗脑头盔</label>
		<description>由太空巨企研发的高级精神控制装置，外观是一款紧贴头部的全封闭头盔。其内部会释放特定光波、影像与音频，对佩戴者进行深层感官刺激与心理暗示，逐步瓦解自我意识并重塑忠诚。在洗脑过程中，雪牛娘的瞳孔会被强光反射，表情僵硬而恍惚，呼吸急促，仿佛陷入一种无法抗拒的快感与恐惧交织的状态。若被强制使用在非巨企派系个体上，他们会因精神崩溃而疯狂攻击附近生物。  解除束缚需要[高科技束具钥匙]，而在解锁后还可通过[束具破解器]进行破解。破解后的头盔会根据佩戴者身份产生不同效果：对于囚犯，每次洗脑都会削弱其逃跑的意志，三次后将被彻底转化为奴隶；对于奴隶，每次洗脑会加深压制感，三次后将完全顺服，不再萌生越狱之心；而对于殖民者，每次洗脑会赋予一种诡异的愉悦情绪，三次后其性格将被永久改变，即便在精神崩溃时也不会再伤害同伴。</description>
		<graphicData>
			<texPath>Things/Apparel/MooGirl_SlaveApparel/MooGirl_BrainwashHelmet/MooGirl_BrainwashHelmet</texPath>
		</graphicData>
		<costList>
			<ComponentSpacer>6</ComponentSpacer>
			<Plasteel>150</Plasteel>
			<Uranium>50</Uranium>
		</costList>
		<statBases>
			<MaxHitPoints>250</MaxHitPoints>
			<Flammability>0.5</Flammability>
			<DeteriorationRate>1.0</DeteriorationRate>
			<Beauty>-6</Beauty>
			<MarketValue>550</MarketValue>
			<Mass>4</Mass>
		</statBases>
		<apparel>
			<parentTagDef>ApparelHead</parentTagDef>
            <useWornGraphicMask>true</useWornGraphicMask>
			<bodyPartGroups>
				<li>HeadAttackTool</li>
			</bodyPartGroups>
			<wornGraphicPath>Things/Apparel/MooGirl_SlaveApparel/MooGirl_BrainwashHelmet/MooGirl_BrainwashHelmet</wornGraphicPath>
            <layers>
                <li>Overhead</li>
            </layers>
		</apparel>
		<BoundBodyPartGroupDefs>
			<li>HeadAttackTool</li>
		</BoundBodyPartGroupDefs>
		<comps>
			<li Class="MooGirl.CompProperties_BrainwashHelmet">
				<defaultHediff>MooGirl_BrainWashing_Level1</defaultHediff>
				<blockHediff>MooGirl_BrainWashing_Level5</blockHediff>
				<convertList>
					<li>
						<hediffToCheck>MooGirl_BrainWashing_Level2</hediffToCheck>
						<hediffToAdd>MooGirl_BrainWashing_Level3</hediffToAdd>
					</li>
					<li>
						<hediffToCheck>MooGirl_BrainWashing_Level4</hediffToCheck>
						<hediffToAdd>MooGirl_BrainWashing_Level5</hediffToAdd>
					</li>
				</convertList>
				<ticksToChange>35000~60000</ticksToChange>
				<!-- 按钮文本与描述 -->
				<activateLabel>激活洗脑</activateLabel>
				<activateDesc>激活洗脑头盔，洗脑目标。</activateDesc>
				<activateIconPath>UI/BrainwashHelmeActivate</activateIconPath>
			</li>
		</comps>
	</MooGirl.SlaveApparelDef>
</Defs>
